  "body": "- **GitHub Actions annotations.** `--github` prints each finding as an annotation on the line that caused it. Thanks to @mvanhorn.\n<pre>`npx impeccable@latest detect --github src/`</pre>\n\n- **The rule list.** `--list-rules` prints every rule without scanning, as text or `--json`.\n\n- **Devin and Replit Agent.** `install` accepts `devin` and `windsurf`, and names Replit Agent when a project has a `.replit` file.\n\n- **Steadier installs.** `install` and `update` wait on an idle connection instead of a fixed 120 seconds, and an update with no network keeps the skills you have. The engine binary is checked against digests committed with the package before it runs.\n\n- **The current detector.** Engine 0.1.18 brings the hard offset shadow advisory and every accuracy fix in skill v4.8.0.",
